{
  "info": {
    "name": "SIAR - Usuarios y Seguridad",
    "description": "Pruebas de autenticacion JWT y permisos por rol del backend SIAR.\n\nUso:\n1. Importar esta coleccion y el environment 'SIAR - Local'.\n2. Seleccionar el environment 'SIAR - Local'.\n3. Ejecutar primero las carpetas en orden (o usar Run collection). Los login guardan el token automaticamente en {{token_admin}} y {{token_mesero}}.\n\nRequisitos:\n- Backend corriendo en {{baseUrl}} con JWT_SECRET configurado.\n- Script DDL y 'Script DML roles SIAR.sql' ejecutados.\n- Usuario admin creado al arrancar (SIAR_ADMIN_PASSWORD en .env).\n- Para la carpeta de permisos se necesita un usuario MESERO. Si no existe, crearlo con:\n\nINSERT INTO USUARIO (id_rol, nombre, correo, usuario, contrasena, activo)\nSELECT r.id_rol, 'Mesero Prueba', 'mesero@siar.local', 'mesero',\n       (SELECT contrasena FROM USUARIO WHERE usuario = 'admin'), 1\nFROM ROL r WHERE r.nombre = 'MESERO';\n\n(queda con la misma contrasena del admin)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Usuarios - Autenticacion",
      "description": "Login, perfil del usuario autenticado y rechazo de credenciales o tokens invalidos.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login admin (guarda token_admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve token Bearer', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "    pm.expect(body.tipo).to.eql('Bearer');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Rol ADMINISTRADOR', () => pm.expect(body.rol).to.eql('ADMINISTRADOR'));",
                  "pm.environment.set('token_admin', body.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"usuario\": \"{{admin_usuario}}\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"{{admin_contrasena}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Inicia sesion con el nombre de usuario. Guarda el token en la variable token_admin."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login admin con correo",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Usuario admin', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().usuario).to.eql(pm.environment.get('admin_usuario')));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"usuario\": \"{{admin_correo}}\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"{{admin_contrasena}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "El campo usuario tambien acepta el correo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login con contrasena incorrecta (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test('Mensaje generico', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().mensaje).to.eql('Usuario o contrasena incorrectos'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"usuario\": \"{{admin_usuario}}\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"clave-incorrecta\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login de usuario inexistente (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test('Mismo mensaje que clave incorrecta', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().mensaje).to.eql('Usuario o contrasena incorrectos'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"usuario\": \"no-existe\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"cualquiera\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login con campos vacios (400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"usuario\": \"\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Perfil del usuario autenticado (me)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Datos del token', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.usuario).to.eql(pm.environment.get('admin_usuario'));",
                  "    pm.expect(body.rol).to.eql('ADMINISTRADOR');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.permisos).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token_admin}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "me"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Perfil sin token (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test('Respuesta JSON de seguridad', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().estado).to.eql(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "me"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Token alterado (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token_admin}}alterado", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/categorias",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "categorias"]
            },
            "description": "Una firma invalida debe ser rechazada."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Permisos - Reglas por rol",
      "description": "Verifica que cada rol solo pueda hacer lo que le corresponde (403 cuando no tiene permiso).",
      "item": [
